# 詞: 銀包

1. 我出門口之前成日都會檢查清楚有冇帶銀包。 (I always check carefully to see if I have brought my wallet before leaving home.)
2. 哎呀，我唔記得帶銀包出街，今餐可唔可以你先墊支？ (Oops, I forgot to bring my wallet out. Can you pay for this meal first?)
3. 佢個銀包入面塞滿晒唔同嘅會員卡同信用卡。 (His wallet is stuffed full of different membership cards and credit cards.)
4. 尋日喺街度執到個銀包，我已經交咗去差館嗰度。 (I picked up a wallet on the street yesterday and have already handed it in to the police station.)
5. 呢個名牌銀包係我女朋友送畀我嘅生日禮物，我好鍾意。 (This designer wallet is a birthday gift from my girlfriend. I like it very much.)
6. 你個銀包咁脹，入面係咪裝滿晒大牛呀？ (Your wallet is so bulky. Is it full of thousand-dollar bills inside?)
7. 小心啲呀，前面嗰條街好多扒手，睇實你個銀包。 (Be careful, there are many pickpockets on the street ahead. Keep a close eye on your wallet.)
8. 我個銀包爛咗，拉鏈壞咗就嚟拉唔郁，諗住周末去買個新嘅。 (My wallet is broken; the zipper is broken and can hardly move. I'm planning to buy a new one this weekend.)
9. 佢買完嗰部新電話之後，個銀包乾到得返幾個銀，呢個月要食穀種喇。 (After buying that new phone, his wallet is completely empty with only a few coins left. He has to live on his last savings this month.)
10. 落的士嗰陣記得攞齊所有嘢，唔好又留低個銀包喺車廂度。 (Remember to take all your belongings when getting out of the taxi. Don't leave your wallet in the cabin again.)

完成10句例句 [end of text]


